# Requirements
# - VSCodeプラグイン REST Client

### シナリオ1 再読込
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/mst_data/refresh
Content-Type: application/json


### シナリオ2 取得
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/mst_data/inquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "table": "db_common.activity_minor_category_mst",
    "column": "conversion_coef",
    "major_category_id": "01",
    "middle_category_id": "0013",
    "minor_category_id": "0000"
}


### シナリオ3 取得 None
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/mst_data/inquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "table": "db_common.activity_minor_category_mst",
    "column": "conversion_coef",
    "major_category_id": "01",
    "middle_category_id": "0013",
    "minor_category_id": "0009"
}


### シナリオ4 取得 dict
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/mst_data/inquiry
